hfstospell
------------------------------------------
This is a minimal hfst optimized lookup format based spell checker library and
a demonstrational implementation of command line based spell checker.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libarchive13-3.8.11-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libglibmm2.4_1-2.54.1-2
  libhfstospell-devel-0.5.4-1bl2
  libhfstospell11-0.5.4-1bl2
  libicu76-76.1-2
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libxml++2.6_2-2.40.1-1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libarchive-devel-3.8.11-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libglibmm2.4-devel-2.54.1-2
  libicu-devel-76.1-2
  libsigc2.0-devel-2.12.1-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libxml++2.6-devel-2.40.1-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/hfst/hfst-ospell/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/hfst/hfst-ospell/archive/refs/tags/v0.5.4.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack hfstospell-0.5.4-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./hfstospell-0.5.4-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/hfstospell-0.5.4-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/hfstospell-0.5.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhfstospell11-0.5.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhfstospell-devel-0.5.4-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(hfstospell)
  /usr/bin/hfst-ospell-office.exe
  /usr/bin/hfst-ospell-predict.exe
  /usr/bin/hfst-ospell.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/hfstospell.README
  /usr/share/doc/hfstospell/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/hfstospell/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/hfstospell/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/hfstospell/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/hfstospell/README.md
  /usr/share/man/man1/hfst-ospell-office.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/hfst-ospell.1.gz

(libhfstospell11)
  /usr/bin/cyghfstospell-11.dll

(libhfstospell-devel)
  /usr/include/ZHfstOspeller.h
  /usr/include/ZHfstOspellerXmlMetadata.h
  /usr/include/hfst-ol.h
  /usr/include/hfstol-stdafx.h
  /usr/include/ol-exceptions.h
  /usr/include/ospell.h
  /usr/lib/libhfstospell.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/hfstospell.pc

